1. Definitions

"Submission" means a character preset together with the images and text that
come with it, submitted by a user.

"Collection" means all Submissions together with the index, metadata, scripts
and workflows in this repository.

"ER Save Manager" means the software published at
https://github.com/Hapfel1/er-save-manager and
https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/9271.

"Authorised Distribution Points" means:
- https://github.com/Hapfel1/er-character-presets
- ER Save Manager

2. Submissions

Each submitter keeps the copyright in their Submission. By submitting, the
submitter:
- confirms that they made the Submission or have the right to submit it, and
  that any character or person it is based on is named in it;
- grants Hapfel a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free, perpetual licence to
  host, copy, display and distribute the Submission through the Authorised
  Distribution Points, and to change it as far as needed for that purpose
  (format conversion, resizing, thumbnails, fixes to the data);
- agrees that the Submission is published under these terms.

A submitter can ask for their Submission to be removed by opening an issue in
this repository. It is then removed from the Collection.

3. Grant of Rights

Anyone may:
- view the Collection;
- download Submissions through the Authorised Distribution Points and apply
  them to their own characters.

4. Restrictions

Unless prior written permission is given by Hapfel:
